        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBUR19ENTR, Keyed Burgundy Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Burgundy Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset is a lovely and stylish keyed door lock that will add historic romance to your front door. This Single Cylinder Keyed Burgundy Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate shows off the stunning design of the Clear Burgundy Crystal Knob, with its scalloped shape. The Fifth Avenue Plate with Burgundy Crystal Knob comes in a wide array of finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/burgundy-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favbur19\"><b>Burgundy Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Burgundy Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Burgundy Crystal Knob with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBUR19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262394\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBUR19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
